[h2]Update for CK3 1.21[/h2]

[b]New[/b]
[list]
[*]Updated for CK3 1.21 and its districts.
[*]All district slots are shown in two rows that scroll sideways.
[*]Add a District Slot button (1,500 gold).
[*]Trade post buttons from the 1.21 holding view: dismantle, oust, revoke, steal, request and expel.
[*]Empty counties use the 1.21 terrain art, with winter versions.
[*]Secrets of Ambrosius: clicking a province in the Mystery Casting map mode opens the Mysteries window aimed at it.
[/list]

[b]Changes[/b]
[list]
[*]No longer replaces gui/hud_outliner.gui, so it conflicts with fewer mods.
[*]Removed old unused code.
[/list]
